    "description": "<p><strong>Tech</strong></p><p><strong>Discharged:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, send an energy blast toward them, dealing <strong>d10+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. Then place this card in your vault.</p><p><strong>Charged:</strong> <strong>Spend a Charge</strong> to make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against all targets in a straight line within Close range. On a success, send an energy blast toward them, dealing <strong>d10+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency.</p><p><strong>Overcharged:</strong> <strong>Spend 2 Charges</strong> to make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against all targets in front of you within Close range. On a success, the target takes <strong>d12+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. Then place this card in your vault.</p>",
